Z||000000||wkayl||07-11-2000||09:10 PM||||I went salvage yard shopping yesterday and found a yard with 2 85 GT's.  They are pretty well stripped, but between the 2 I can get a factory sunroof setup for my 86 GT.  Previous owner installed an aftermarket sunroof in my car.  Both 85's have the steering wheels.  1 is brown in good shape and other is grey in bad shape.  Neither has horn buttons.  Of the quarter sale panels only 1 drivers side is worth getting.  The ECM is in one .  It had an automatic.  I will post some pictures that I took while I was there.  I am planning on getting the roof on July 26th or 27th.  I will also post this in the Mall||||reg||1
Z||000001||286SE'S||07-12-2000||11:15 AM||||Pictures! they let you take Pictures in the Junk yard!!! The yards around here (Pasadena, California) have signs that read "Absolutely NO Cameras" I am not sure why. I would love to get a photo of some of the doners to my car. Also how well the crashed ones have protected the occupants. The burned ones are scary!<BR>Terry||||reg||1
